OL,3,GNEWSADiving suit fundraiser Lloyd Scott
OL,4,Adies
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former footballer and prolific
OL,7,Fcharity fundraiser who famously took
OL,8,Fsix days to complete the London
OL,9,FMarathon in a deep sea diving suit has
OL,10,Fdied.
OL,12,FLloyd Scott, from Theydon Bois, Essex,
OL,13,Fwho was 65, raised more than #5m
OL,14,Fthroughout five decades of charity
OL,15,Fruns, challenges and feats. He ran his
OL,16,Flast London Marathon in 2023 dressed as
OL,17,FCaptain Scarlet.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
