OL,3,GNEWSADiving suit fundraiser Lloyd Scott
OL,4,Adies
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fundraiser who was a former
OL,7,Fgoalkeeper for Leyton Orient, twice
OL,8,Fsurvived cancer, in 1989 and 2022, but
OL,9,Fannounced a third diagnosis in
OL,10,FSeptember 2023.
OL,12,FPaying tribute to Scott, former England
OL,13,Fgoalkeeper Peter Shilton said he was
OL,14,F"devastated" and called him a "great
OL,15,Ffriend".
